","p":"DEM","tr":"dhālika","f":["MS"],"l":19},{"i":"33:6:27","a":"فِى","t":"in","p":"P","tr":"fī","l":3},{"i":"33:6:28","a":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","t":"the Book","p":"N","tr":"l-kitābi","f":["M","GEN"],"r":22,"l":49,"g":[["ٱلْ","DET","prefix","Al"],["ْكِتَـٰ","N","stem","M|GEN"]]},{"i":"33:6:29","a":"مَسْطُورًۭا","t":"written","p":"N","tr":"masṭūran","f":["PASS","PCPL","M","INDEF","ACC"],"r":456,"l":1889},{"e":"٦","v":"33:6"}]}],"verses":[{"k":"33:1","t":"O Prophet, fear Allāh and do not obey the disbelievers and the hypocrites. Indeed, Allāh is ever Knowing and Wise.","j":21,"h":42,"s":33,"a":1,"sd":null},{"k":"33:2","t":"And follow that which is revealed to you from your Lord. Indeed Allāh is ever, of what you do, Aware.","j":21,"h":42,"s":33,"a":2,"sd":null},{"k":"33:3","t":"And rely upon Allāh; and sufficient is Allāh as Disposer of affairs.","j":21,"h":42,"s":33,"a":3,"sd":null},{"k":"33:4","t":"Allāh has not made for a man two hearts in his interior. And He has not made your wives whom you declare unlawful your mothers. And He has not made your claimed [i.e., adopted] sons your [true] sons. That is [merely] your saying by your mouths, but Allāh says the truth, and He guides to the [right] way.","j":21,"h":42,"s":33,"a":4,"sd":null},{"k":"33:5","t":"Call them by [the names of] their fathers; it is more just in the sight of Allāh. But if you do not know their fathers - then they are [still] your brothers in religion and those entrusted to you. And there is no blame upon you for that in which you have erred but [only for] what your hearts intended. And ever is Allāh Forgiving and Merciful.","j":21,"h":42,"s":33,"a":5,"sd":null},{"k":"33:6","t":"The Prophet is more worthy of the believers than themselves, and his wives are [in the position of] their mothers. And those of [blood] relationship are more entitled [to inheritance] in the decree of Allāh than the [other] believers and the emigrants, except that you may do to your close associates a kindness [through bequest]. That was in the Book inscribed.","j":21,"h":42,"s":33,"a":6,"sd":null}],"juz":21,"hizb":42,"surahs":[33],"sajdah":false}